      "title": "World Sustainability Prototype Operation",
      "subtitle": "Make engineering samples and keep true maintenance records",
      "description": [
        "\"Invest the anchor components, controlled nanoswarm and soul steel plate on the world maintenance test platform, and complete the prototype operation. Obtain the world maintenance project sample and the real maintenance receipt, continue the research on civilization wonder materials and prepare for the second trial.\""
