      "title": "Wonder component prefabrication",
      "subtitle": "Assembling four types of composite materials into universal prefabricated components",
      "description": [
        "\"Send the four composite materials of energy guidance, restraint, reconstruction and cognition into the prefabricated equipment and fit them into the IRV casing. Collect the prefabricated components, leftover materials and hot coolant, save the actual prefabricated record, and continue the research on the project acceptance method.\""
