      "id": "4B5D42853DBE1968",
      "title": "Civilized project acceptance method",
      "subtitle": "RN-CEE · Experimental and Formal Research",
      "description": [
        "\"Tested object: World Sustainability Project sample × 1; paper 2 is used for testing records, and the reference sample is recycled\"",
        "\"Complete the team's experiment in the legacy technology reverse laboratory. Really detect known reference parts, and verify that the judgment rules can distinguish qualified/unqualified samples; only evidence of the acceptance method is formed; the original quantity of the inspected object is returned, and the experiment is based on the actual settlement of the machine.\"",
        "\"After the experiment is completed, choose 6120 research points or WFV circuit × 8, neutron plate × 128 to pay the base fee; an additional 36,000 ticks and 135,107,988,821,114,880 EU/t are required. The current material pressure correction is required for advanced ones.\"",
        "\"The institute withholds power based on the total power of the effective energy ports. After completion, the Civilization Project Acceptance Center will be unlocked; research on acceptance methods does not equal obtaining actual operation proof of each wonder.\""
      ],
