      "subtitle": "RN-WMS · Experimental and formal research",
      "description": [
        "\"Tested object: World Sustainability Project sample × 1; paper 2 is used for testing records, and the reference sample is recycled\"",
        "\"Complete the team's experiments in the legacy technology reverse laboratory. The test pieces are actually manufactured and the adaptation test under maintenance conditions is completed. The test pieces cannot be used as formal composite materials; the original quantity of the tested object is returned, and the experiment is subject to the actual settlement of the machine.\"",
        "\"After the experiment is completed, choose 5380 research points or IWV circuit × 8, neutron plate × 120 to pay the base fee; an additional 33,600 ticks and 33,776,997,205,278,720 EU/t are required. The current material pressure correction is required for advanced ones.\"",
        "\"The research institute deducts power according to the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, unlock the starting giant materials of the Civilized Wonder Material Synthesis Center to avoid using self-produced materials of the target wonder to build the first wonder.\""
