        "\"Complete the team's experiment in the legacy technology reverse laboratory. The actual completion of the interface, tolerance and load-bearing test piece testing is related to the product batch of the Civilized Wonder Material Synthesis Center; the test piece is not a wonder controller; the original quantity of the inspected object is returned, and the experiment is subject to the actual settlement of the machine.\"",
        "\"After the experiment is completed, choose 5380 research points or IWV circuit × 8, neutron plate × 120 to pay the base fee; an additional 33,600 ticks and 33,776,997,205,278,720 EU/t are required. The current material pressure correction is required for advanced ones.\"",
